{"id":"erste","lemma":"erste","pos":"adj","rank":332,"glosses":["first"],"ipa":"/ˈeːrstə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/72/De-erste.ogg/De-erste.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche Erste Hilfe.","en":"I need first aid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/395088","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"the act of helping"}]},{"text":"Es ist nicht das erste Mal.","en":"It's not the first time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701104","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"just / once"}]},{"text":"Sonntag ist der erste Tag der Woche.","en":"Sunday is the first day of the week.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41620","words":[{"g":"Sunday"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"day"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"week"}]},{"text":"Die erste Nacht war schrecklich.","en":"The first night was awful.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"night"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"awfully, terribly"}]},{"text":"Sie war meine erste Freundin.","en":"She was my first girlfriend.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"friend","l":"Freund"}]}]}